# Actual Pontryagin products and marked exterior maps for period tori

This entry point imports the genuine products on integral singular homology,
their proved low-degree coherence and alternation, and the natural exterior-square
and exterior-cube maps for the actual period and product tori. Bijectivity of
these exterior maps is a separate assertion and is not assumed in this construction.
